{"id":"d84487411a19c7f3","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting.md","title":"Friedberg 分裂保持所有非 c.e. 差集","display":"thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting — Friedberg 分裂保持所有非 c.e. 差集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting","aliases":["20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting"],"display":"thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting — Friedberg 分裂保持所有非 c.e. 差集","chapter":"2","section":"2.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.7.1；Exercise 2.7.2","source_printed_pages":[49,50],"source_pdf_pages":[85,86],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]","[[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting — Friedberg 分裂保持所有非 c.e. 差集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.7.1；Exercise 2.7.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span><span>86</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8aedee3e7e32f49\" href=\"?note=e8aedee3e7e32f49\" title=\"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable\">20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=W_b\">\\(B=W_b\\)</span>；c.e. 集合 W 的差集使用静态集合差。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8aedee3e7e32f49\" href=\"?note=e8aedee3e7e32f49\" title=\"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable\">20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ec065689fdce567\" href=\"?note=8ec065689fdce567\" title=\"20-thm-single-event-enumeration\">20-thm-single-event-enumeration</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\ (W\\setminus B\\notin\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}W\\setminus A_i\\notin\\mathcal E)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\ (W\\setminus B\\notin\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow\\bigwedge_{i&lt;2}W\\setminus A_i\\notin\\mathcal E)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取包含标准 W_e 与 B 的单事件枚举。当 x 新入 B 时，选择最小的尚无 W_e∩A_i 见证、且 x 已在 W_e 中的需求〈e,i〉，把 x 分配到 A_i；没有适用需求就给 A₀。每需求至多成功一次，过程从 b 统一有效。若 W_e\\B 非 c.e.，动态流引理给无限多个 W_e 先入、后入 B 的机会；有限高优先级需求各至多抢走一个，故目标需求必成功。若 W\\A_i 为 c.e.，设它等于 W_e；因 A_i⊆B，有 W_e\\B=W\\B，目标需求使 W_e∩A_i≠∅，与 W_e=W\\A_i 矛盾。统一程序编译给从 b 得到两边索引的全可计算函数。无需判定 B 非计算或 W\\B 非 c.e.。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.7.1；Exercise 2.7.2；印刷页 49, 50；PDF 第 85, 86 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e8aedee3e7e32f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-single-event-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8ec065689fdce567","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e8aedee3e7e32f49","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-single-event-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8ec065689fdce567","anchor":"ref-6","ta